# Line breaks are LF in the repository and in every checkout, Windows too:
# the build and the tests read files as they are. A checkout made before
# this file still has CRLF on disk (git won't rewrite it, not even with
# `git add --renormalize`): tests/lineEndings.test.ts says so, and
# `npm run fix-eol` turns it back to LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
